HAI
    WAZZUP
        I HAS A zeroNumbr ITZ 0
        I HAS A positiveNumbr ITZ 10
        I HAS A negativeNumbr ITZ -5
        I HAS A zeroNumbar ITZ 0.0
        I HAS A positiveNumbar ITZ 3.14
        I HAS A result1
        I HAS A result2
        I HAS A result3
        I HAS A result4
        I HAS A result5
    BUHBYE

    result1 R MAEK zeroNumbr A TROOF
    result2 R MAEK positiveNumbr A TROOF
    result3 R MAEK negativeNumbr A TROOF
    result4 R MAEK zeroNumbar A TROOF
    result5 R MAEK positiveNumbar A TROOF

    VISIBLE result1
    VISIBLE result2
    VISIBLE result3
    VISIBLE result4
    VISIBLE result5
KTHXBYE